OL,4,BStoke & Blues proving never judge book 
OL,5,Bby its cover                           
OL,6,GStoke City v Birmingham City: Third v  
OL,7,Gfirst in the Championship.             
OL,9,FThat is a "tale of two cities" that    
OL,10,Fdid not look too likely to get written 
OL,11,Fwhen Mark Robins' Potters started this 
OL,12,Fseason with three straight defeats and 
OL,13,FBlues won only two of their first      
OL,14,Feight league games under Chris Davies. 
OL,16,FBut, just like you should never judge  
OL,17,Fa book by its cover, the footballing   
OL,18,Fequivalent is to never judge any       
OL,19,Fleague table until after 10 games.     
